		<h1>Nice to meet you</h1>
	</div>

	<section class="about-intro container">
		<p>
			I've been building software professionally since I was 18. Today, most of my work happens somewhere between engineering, product, and customers: building teams, designing systems, and solving technical problems.
		</p>
		<br>
		<p>
			I still consider myself an engineer first — I just spend more of my time thinking about people, organisations, and how good engineering gets done.
		</p>
		<br>
		<p>
			When I'm not thinking about software, I'm probably thinking about cacti.
		</p>
	</section>

